from casino owner Terry Benedict (García), the lover of Ocean's ex-wife Tess (Roberts).

15
01:22:51,428 --> 01:22:57,428
Ocean's Eleven was theatrically released in the United
States on December 7, 2001, by Warner Bros.

16
01:28:22,857 --> 01:28:28,857
The film received positive reviews from critics and was a major box-office hit, grossing
$450.7 million worldwide and becoming the fifth-highest-grossing film of 2001.

17
01:33:54,285 --> 01:34:00,285
Soderbergh directed two sequels, Ocean's Twelve in
2004 and Ocean's Thirteen in 2007.

18
